      "name": "Mykola",
      "created_at": "2026-02-21T18:30:48.547Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi, I am encountering a hardcoded validation error in Frappe child tables: <strong>“The total column width cannot be more than 10”</strong>. This limit prevents me from fully customizing both standard tables (like Items) and my own custom tables, where I need to display 15-20+ columns in List View.</p>\n<p>Is there a way to bypass or override this limit to add more fields? Additionally, what is the best solution to enable a horizontal scroll (similar to Report View) so that columns maintain a readable width instead of shrinking?</p>",
